    "analysis_plan": "Stream 40 diverse 'flores' records through the Kimera 'entity' target; flatten all numeric leaves in CycleResult.raw per cycle; classify each signal live (>=2 distinct values) vs frozen (constant). Decide liveness_rate against threshold >= 80%. Wilson 95% CI on the proportion. The frozen-signal worklist (by organ) is in the proof evidence.",
    "sweep_grid": {},
